    "faqs_orders": {
      "type": "custom-faqs",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_q21": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How much does MUTO cost?",
            "content": "<p>MUTO is £60 a month on a monthly subscription, £150 every three months on the three-month plan (about £1.67 a day), or £70 as a one-time purchase. Every subscription includes free UK next-day delivery and the 90-day money-back guarantee.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_q22": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why does MUTO cost more than an NR supplement on its own?",
            "content": "<p>A single NR product covers one input. MUTO includes NR at the maximum dose authorised in Great Britain (300mg), plus a methylated B complex, D3, K2, zinc, copper, CoQ10 (as ubiquinone), PQQ, resveratrol and TMG. Many people already buy these separately. On the three-month plan it’s about £1.67 a day. Compare it with what’s in your cupboard, and remember you have 90 days to decide.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_q23": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Which plan should I choose?",
            "content": "<p>Choose the three-month plan if you want a proper test: it’s the lowest daily price and lines up with the 90-day window we recommend for judging MUTO. The monthly plan spreads the cost. Both subscriptions are covered by the 90-day guarantee; a one-time purchase isn’t. <a href=\"/products/muto-nad-cellular-complex\">Compare plans.</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_q24": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What’s in the welcome kit and gifts?",
            "content": "<p>With your first subscription order you get performance socks, a Forever Jar, our 12-week protocol guide and entry into our competition to win an Oura Ring. Subscribers also get a thank-you gift with later orders. Gifts are while stocks last. <a href=\"/pages/better-baseline-giveaway\">Competition terms apply.</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_q25": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do subscribers get creatine?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. From 14 October 2026, subscribers receive MUTO Ultrapure Micronised Creatine as a gift with later orders. One serving is 5g. Creatine increases physical performance in successive bursts of short-term, high-intensity exercise; the beneficial effect is obtained with a daily intake of 3g.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_q26": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I skip, pause or cancel?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, anytime, online. Log in to your account to skip a delivery, pause, change your plan or cancel, with no phone call and no fees. We email you a reminder 5 days before every payment.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_q27": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does delivery work?",
            "content": "<p>UK delivery is free and next-day for orders placed before 9pm, arriving within 1–2 working days. International shipping is calculated at checkout. You’ll get a tracking link by email when your order ships. See <a href=\"/pages/shipping-and-return\">Shipping &amp; Returns</a> for details.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_q28": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Where can I buy MUTO?",
            "content": "<p>Buy MUTO direct at muto.co, where subscriptions and the 90-day guarantee apply. It’s also available on Amazon, though Amazon orders aren’t covered by our guarantee.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
